      {
        "Id": "d434b48df9fb45ad86eefaf560f02e77",
        "Title": "HOW TO USE:  open the plan (or ALL = whole model).  Every door / window gets a concrete LINTEL: width = wall (or 5), depth 3, bearing 4 into the wall each side, underside at the head height.  JAMB POSTS (6): a concrete post each side, floor to lintel, width 7 along the wall; a side that already has a column gets none.  RUN False = counts only.  Run again = replaced.",
        "DescriptionText": "",
